{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26159","headline":"送宫人入道 · 张萧远","name":"送宫人入道","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"舍宠求仙畏色衰，辞天素面立堦墀。\n金丹拟驻千年貌，玉指休匀八字眉。\n师主与收珠翠後，君王看戴角冠时。\n从来宫女皆相妬，闻向瑶台尽泪垂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张萧远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26159.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26159","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}